								{
									"type": "text",
									"marks": [
										{
											"type": "bold"
										}
									],
									"text": "S3 (Simple Storage Service)"
								},
								{
									"type": "text",
									"text": " is the equivalent of Azure Blob Storage. It uses \"Buckets\" to store raw files as objects."
